var e=[{id:`mail_cake_1`,sender:`HR (Sabine)`,senderId:`hr_sabine`,subj:`Cake in the kitchen! 🍰`,body:`Dear all,

I have baked a vegan, gluten-free courgette cake! Help yourselves!

(Only 1 slice per person please!)`,opts:[{t:`Reply all: 'Where is the Mett?'`,r:`Your reply goes out to three hundred recipients. The first laughing emojis arrive, then a read receipt from HR - without an emoji. The joke was probably worth it. The bill comes later.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_cake_2`},{t:`Take a slice`,r:`You politely take a slice. It has the texture of damp cardboard and tastes of good intentions. You eat all of it while Sabine watches. An investment in industrial peace.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_cake_2`,linked:!0,sender:`HR (Sabine)`,senderId:`hr_sabine`,subj:`Re: Cake in the kitchen! 🍰`,body:`I do not find that funny at all, Mr Miller!

We are trying to build an inclusive atmosphere here! I have put your name on the 'no-Christmas-bonus' list.`,opts:[{t:`It was worth it.`,r:`You walk to the bakery round the corner and demonstratively buy a Mettbrötchen with onions. It is the most expensive Mettbrötchen of your life - it costs a Christmas bonus - and it tastes of exactly that.`,m:5,l:-5,a:-5,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ticket_fire`,sender:`TicketSystem`,senderId:`ticket_system`,subj:`TICKET #9942: Mouse on fire.`,body:`PRIORITY: CRITICAL 
USER: Gabi (Reception) 
DESCRIPTION: 'Help, smoke is coming out of my mouse and it smells of burnt plastic. I tried putting it out with coffee, now it sparks blue.' 
STATUS: OPEN`,opts:[{t:`Delete the ticket`,r:`Ticket closed, reason given: 'Cannot reproduce.' That it is still smoking on Gabi's desk now falls under 'hardware, physical' - a category famously without an owner.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:5},{t:`Call the fire brigade`,r:`Two appliances, six firefighters, a cordoned-off foyer. The officer in charge holds up the smouldering mouse like a rescued kitten. It was the coffee in the electronics. Gabi waves at the crew, delighted.`,m:2,l:-5,a:-5,b:10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_workshop_breathing`,sender:`Works Council`,senderId:`works_council`,subj:`Invitation: 'Breathing properly at work'`,body:`Namaste dear fellow slaves... er, colleagues. 

We invite you to the workshop 'Breathing against burnout'. Together we will learn how to turn rage into CO2. There will be vegan spelt biscuits (gluten-free, sugar-free, flavour-free). Attendance is recommended.`,opts:[{t:`Mark as spam`,r:`You flag the works council as a source of spam. The filter will now quietly handle what still cost you a click today. Automation is a form of self-care too.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Attend`,r:`You sit in a circle of chairs for half an hour and breathe on command. It is remarkably hard not to think about open tickets while doing it. The spelt biscuits taste exactly the way they sound.`,m:30,l:15,a:-10,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_toilet_1`,sender:`Facilities Mgt`,senderId:`facilities`,subj:`Third floor toilets closed (burst pipe).`,body:`ATTENTION: Following an... incident... involving an unnamed member of staff and half a roll of paper towels, the toilets on the third floor are closed. The water is 5cm deep.

Please wear wellingtons or hold on.`,opts:[{t:`Reply all: 'This is what the cuts get you!'`,r:`Your remark about the cuts hits a nerve. Within minutes forty people reply, three of them in capitals, one with a chart. Nobody is interested in the actual pipe any more.`,m:2,l:5,a:10,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_toilet_revolution`},{t:`Reply all: 'Would never have happened in my day!!!11'`,r:`Six words, one exclamation mark too many, and the thread explodes in every direction at once. An hour later two hundred people are discussing everything except toilets.`,m:2,l:5,a:10,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_toilet_politics`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_toilet_revolution`,linked:!0,sender:`Works Council (Uwe)`,senderId:`works_council_uwe`,subj:`RE: Third floor toilets closed`,body:`COMRADES! Miller is right!

Single-ply paper is a crime against humanity! Management is probably using silk!

We demand: 4 ply for all! From tomorrow: GENERAL STRIKE outside the loos!`,opts:[{t:`Declare solidarity.`,r:`You reply with a raised fist emoji. Uwe prints posters, somebody hums the Internationale at the copier. All you wanted was softer paper - now you are the figurehead of a movement.`,m:2,l:10,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_toilet_politics`,linked:!0,sender:`All Employees`,senderId:`all_employees`,subj:`RE: RE: RE: Third floor toilets closed`,body:`System message: this email thread has 400 new replies.

Subject lines include: 'Climate change', 'Flat earth', 'Speed limits', 'Banning schnitzel'.

The mail server is smoking. Nobody is working any more.`,opts:[{t:`Fetch popcorn.`,r:`You read along without joining in and actually get something from the vending machine. Reply 401 compares paper towels to the fall of Rome. Best programming in years.`,m:2,l:15,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_phish_test_bonus`,sender:`IT-Sec`,senderId:`it_sec`,subj:`Phishing test: click here for your bonus!`,body:`Dear Employee. 

We have determined that your salary is too low. To receive your immediate bonus of 5,000 EUR, please enter your Windows password and the name of your first pet on the following page: 
[Change-MyPassword.ru]`,opts:[{t:`Report as phishing`,r:`Exemplary conduct. IT sends you back a thumbs-up smiley and nothing else.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:-5},{t:`Click at once!`,r:`TEST FAILED! A red window pops up: 'CAN YOU NOT SEE THAT THIS IS FAKE?!' A report has already gone to the boss.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_kevin_noise`,sender:`Kevin (Apprentice)`,senderId:`kevin_apprentice`,subj:`Help!! My PC is making weird noises`,body:`Heyyy? My PC goes 'Krrrrtzzz Krrrrtzz' and smells a bit like electricity. I gave it a good kick, now it's smoking a little. Is that a new feature? Should I pour water on it?`,opts:[{t:`'Run!'`,r:`Your reply is one word and an exclamation mark. You hear Kevin's chair go over through two walls. His reaction time in an emergency is, it must be said, outstanding.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:5},{t:`Go over`,r:`A cable tie had found its way into the fan, and the kick only worked it in deeper. You pull it out with two fingers and log the case as 'mechanical foreign object'. Kevin calls you a wizard.`,m:5,l:-5,a:-5,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_leak_1`,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`FW: Q4 redundancies (CONFIDENTIAL)`,body:`To: The board
Cc: (Accidentally) All staff

Gentlemen, attached is the list of the 50 employees we are letting go next Monday. Please treat with discretion.

[Attachment: List_FINAL_v3.pdf]`,opts:[{t:`Reply all: 'AM I ON IT TOO?!'`,r:`You have replied to every name on that distribution list. Panic breaks out.`,m:2,l:-10,a:10,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_leak_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`You click delete and then stare through the monitor for two minutes. Fifty names. You did not read a single one and still saw too many.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:-5,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_leak_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`RE: FW: Q4 redundancies (CONFIDENTIAL)`,body:`MILLER?! 

How dare you?! That was a test! To check... loyalty! Come to my office AT ONCE!

(This will be a long conversation...)`,opts:[{t:`Oops...`,r:`Twenty minutes of dressing-down in which the word 'loyalty' comes up more often than in any mafia film. He never mentions the list again. Neither do you. The two of you have a balance of silence.`,m:20,l:0,a:20,b:10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_chantal_affair_1`,sender:`Chantal (Private)`,senderId:`chantal_private`,subj:`Re: Weekend`,body:`Hey bunny 🐰, the boss is doing my head in so badly. Meet me in the archive in 5 mins? I smuggled in coffee and those amazing chocolate cookies. Nobody finds us between the files from 1990. 😘`,opts:[{t:`'I know everything. Hush money?'`,r:`You send back exactly one sentence and let it work. For three minutes Outlook shows 'Chantal is typing...'. Then nothing. Then 'is typing...' again. You have time.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_chantal_panic`},{t:`Forward to: Dr. Wichtig`,r:`You click forward, enter the boss and send the mail on its way without a word. Some messages speak loudest when nothing is added to them.`,m:2,l:0,a:-10,b:-20,nextEmail:`mail_chantal_boss_reply`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_chantal_boss_reply`,linked:!0,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`RE: FW: Re: Weekend`,body:`Mr Miller,

Excellent vigilance. Laziness is a cancer in this company.

I have just invited Ms Chantal in 'for a conversation'. Take a biscuit from her office while she is away.

Carry on.`,opts:[{t:`The biscuit tastes of betrayal.`,r:`You eat the biscuit in Chantal's empty office, standing up, like a burglar. It tastes excellent, and that is what makes it worse. The boss is on your side - for the first time that worries you.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:-10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_chantal_panic`,linked:!0,sender:`Chantal (Private)`,senderId:`chantal_private`,subj:`Re: Re: Weekend`,body:`OMG MILLER?! 😱😱😱

Please don't say anything!! That was for... er... my gran! Keep quiet and I'll make your PowerPoint pretty for tomorrow! And you get all the cookies! DEAL?!`,opts:[{t:`Deal.`,r:`The deal stands. From tomorrow your presentations look like an agency made them, and there are cookies on your desk. You wonder briefly whether this is blackmail. Formally: yes. But with biscuits.`,m:2,l:15,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_compliance_sitting`,sender:`HR Compliance Bot`,senderId:`hr_compliance_bot`,subj:`URGENT: e-learning 'Sitting properly' overdue`,body:`Dear Employee, our system indicates that you have not yet completed the mandatory module 'Ergonomics at the workstation part 4b: the perfect 90-degree angle'. The video runs for 45 minutes and cannot be skipped. Please complete this by EOB, otherwise your access will be suspended.`,opts:[{t:`Mark as 'completed'`,r:`You edit the database directly. A risk, but it saves time.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:5},{t:`Let the video run`,r:`You leave the video running in the background. The audio grates, but you are compliant.`,m:5,l:10,a:5,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. The next reminder is bound to come.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_replyall_cat`,sender:`Distribution: ALL (Re: Re: Re: Cat)`,senderId:`distribution_all_cat`,subj:`RE: RE: RE: Who is missing 'Mimi'?`,body:`PLEASE TAKE ME OFF THIS DISTRIBUTION LIST!!!! I DO NOT HAVE A CAT!!! THIS IS A WORK EMAIL ACCOUNT!!! (Previous message from Gabi: 'Oh how sweet, is she fluffy!'). (Previous message from Klaus: 'Mimi is back, thanks everyone!').`,opts:[{t:`Reply all: 'QUIET!'`,r:`You have contributed to the escalation. Now 50 people are replying 'Stop replying to all!'. The mail server is starting to steam.`,m:2,l:0,a:20,b:10},{t:`Create a filter rule`,r:`You filter 'Mimi' straight into the bin. Heavenly quiet.`,m:5,l:-5,a:-10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_chantal_wording`,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`Wording check - ASAP!!!`,body:`Hiiii! 👋 We're printing the flyers for the trade fair any minute now. Can you have a quick look? It says: 'Our cloud solution synergises with the blockchain AI to optimise the Wi-Fi cable.' Does that sound techy enough? Need the GO in 2 minutes!!! 😘`,opts:[{t:`Correct the text`,r:`You explain to her, laboriously, that Wi-Fi cables do not exist. She does not take it in. 'But it sounds good!'`,m:5,l:-10,a:10,b:0},{t:`'Perfect!'`,r:`You have waved the nonsense through. The IT community will laugh at us, but Chantal is happy.`,m:2,l:10,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_krause_fridge`,sender:`Egon the Caretaker`,senderId:`egon_caretaker`,subj:`Fridge, floor 3`,body:`Morning. Found a plastic tub in the fridge with 'Lunch 2019' on it. The contents have grown fur by now and growl at me when I put the light on. Would the owner please report to me with a flamethrower, otherwise I bin it along with the fridge.`,opts:[{t:`That's mine!`,r:`You rescue your... whatever that was. It smells foul.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. What lives in the fridge stays in the fridge.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ceo_vision`,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`Vision 2030 - your ideas!`,body:`Dear team, last night at the wellness retreat I had a vision. We must become more 'agile'. I would like each of you to send me a 10-page concept by 12:00 on how we can use AI to save coffee. Think outside the box! Go, go, go!`,opts:[{t:`Answer honestly`,r:`You write: 'This is nonsense.' The boss makes a note of your name and was not delighted.`,m:5,l:0,a:10,b:20},{t:`Use ChatGPT`,r:`You have an AI write the bullshit concept. The boss is thrilled: 'Visionary!'`,m:5,l:10,a:-5,b:-10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. With luck he will forget about it.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_wuttke_excel`,sender:`H. Wuttke (Accounts)`,senderId:`wuttke_accounts`,subj:`HELP! EXCEL HAS GONE RED!`,body:`Mr IT!!! I didn't do anything, honestly! All I wanted was to delete column G and now everything is red and flashing! The balance sheet has to go out in 10 minutes! If that's gone, I'm dead! Come over here now! Why does this always happen to me?!`,opts:[{t:`Go over`,r:`Wuttke had his elbow on the Del key; the accounts were never in danger. Two keystrokes and it is all back. He calls you a lifesaver and is still telling the story at lunch.`,m:5,l:-10,a:10,b:-5},{t:`Insist on a ticket`,r:`You insist on the proper channel. Wuttke's ticket arrives twelve minutes later, evidently dictated, entirely in capitals, category 'EMERGENCY RED'. The accounts can wait. Principles cannot.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_circle_mindfulness`,sender:`Works Council`,senderId:`works_council`,subj:`Invitation: 'Mindfulness' circle`,body:`Dear colleagues, given the high stress levels we are holding a circle of chairs today. We will be silent together and dance our names. There will be herbal tea from the catering pack. Participation is voluntary (but noted).`,opts:[{t:`Go along`,r:`You dance your name. For 'Miller' that is essentially one lunge. The herbal tea tastes of hayloft, but the half hour counts as working time, and that makes up for a lot.`,m:30,l:20,a:-10,b:5},{t:`Mark as spam`,r:`The filter learns: subject lines containing 'mindfulness' go unread into the folder marked 'Workplace culture'. There are a fair few in there by now. That folder is the most mindful place you own.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_phish_1`,sender:`Security Service`,senderId:`security_guards`,subj:`Urgent: your password is expiring!`,body:`Hello User,

your password is too old. Click HERE to change it and receive a €500 Amazon voucher as a reward!

Link: http://bit.ly/hacker-klaus`,opts:[{t:`Report as phishing`,r:`You report the mail and get an automated thank-you with three spelling mistakes in it. For a moment you check whether that one is a phishing test as well. In this building you never can tell.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Click the link`,r:`The link opens a page that looks like the intranet after three pints. While you are still staring at the password field, IT quietly suspends your account. For your own protection, they say.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_phish_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_phish_2`,linked:!0,sender:`IT-Security Bot`,senderId:`it_security_bot`,subj:`ALERT: YOU HAVE FAILED`,body:`This was an internal security test.
You did not pass.

Consequence: your internet access has been throttled to 'modem speed' until you have completed the course 'Operating a mouse for beginners'.`,opts:[{t:`Damn.`,r:`Every page now loads at the speed of remembrance, image by image, like 1997. You watch the progress bar think and feel a fan spin up somewhere inside you.`,m:2,l:-5,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_erna_virus`,sender:`Auntie Erna (Private)`,senderId:`aunt_erna`,subj:`FWD: FWD: FWD: Funny!!!!`,body:`Look at this, love, you have to see it! 😂😂😂 The cat falls off the chair! I laughed myself silly! Show it to your colleagues! Love, Auntie Erna. PS: how do you switch the internet on? (Attachment: funny.ppt.exe - 50MB)`,opts:[{t:`Open the attachment`,r:`The attachment is called 'funny.ppt.exe', and you click it anyway. The virus scanner goes to full alert and the machine shuts everything down as a precaution. The cat, incidentally, was not even in the attachment.`,m:10,l:-20,a:20,b:20},{t:`Reply kindly and lie`,r:`You write 'Very funny, Auntie Erna!' without touching the attachment. She replies within minutes with four more forwards. Kindness has a price with Auntie Erna, and it is paid in attachments.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_scam_package`,sender:`Unknown`,senderId:`unknown`,subj:`Your parcel could not be delivered`,body:`Hello Customer. Your parcel is held at customs. Please transfer the €2.50 fee via this link, otherwise we burn your parcel. Link: www.totally-legit-dhl-scam.ru`,opts:[{t:`'Keep it.'`,r:`You reply 'Keep it, I don't need anything.' Delivery fails; the sender address does not exist at all. Somewhere out there an imaginary parcel is presumably going up in flames.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Open the website`,r:`A phishing page! You almost entered your details. IT security noticed.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:15},{t:`Mark as spam`,r:`Reported, filtered, done. Customs do not charge fees through links ending in .ru - that knowledge is what separates the survivors in this firm from the course attendees.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_wuttke_1`,sender:`H. Wuttke (Accounts)`,senderId:`wuttke_accounts`,subj:`(No subject)`,body:`goulash recipe easy quick no peppers`,opts:[{t:`Forward to: Dr. Wichtig`,r:`You forward the goulash recipe upstairs without comment. What the boss makes of it is out of your hands. A small, mean part of you is looking forward to the reply.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:-10,nextEmail:`mail_wuttke_boss`},{t:`'Horst, this is Outlook.'`,r:`You explain to Wuttke the difference between Outlook and a search engine. He thanks you politely. His next mail will tell you how much of it landed.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_wuttke_ai`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_wuttke_ai`,linked:!0,sender:`H. Wuttke (Accounts)`,senderId:`wuttke_accounts`,subj:`RE: (No subject)`,body:`Thank you Outlook.

Please also order 2 pots of cream and pasta. But not the spiral kind, my wife doesn't like those.

Send.`,opts:[{t:`You don't want to understand, do you?`,r:`You stare at the screen. There is no patch for stupidity of this order.`,m:2,l:5,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_wuttke_boss`,linked:!0,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`FW: (No subject)`,body:`Miller,

thank you for forwarding this.

Tell Wuttke to put peppers in, otherwise it will not taste of anything. And while he is cooking he can bring a portion up to the fourth floor.

(You get nothing. Nobody likes a snitch.)`,opts:[{t:`Marvellous...`,r:`Wuttke cooks for the fourth floor at the weekend and the boss publicly praises 'our lived company culture'. Your name does not come up once in the whole affair. You were only fate's postman.`,m:2,l:0,a:15,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_sabine_tupper`,sender:`HR (Sabine)`,senderId:`hr_sabine`,subj:`WHO HAS TAKEN MY TUB?!`,body:`That is the third time now! My red tub with the 'SABINE' sticker on it is gone! I am going to search every desk! If I find it, God help you! I am calling the police!`,opts:[{t:`Reply all: 'Calm down'`,r:`Mistake! Sabine loses it completely. She throws a stapler across the office. You have to take cover under the desk.`,m:2,l:0,a:20,b:10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. Not your problem. Let them fight it out.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_alert_login`,sender:`SYSTEM ALERT (Automated)`,senderId:`system_alert_automated`,subj:`CRITICAL: Suspicious Login (CEO Account)`,body:`Detected Login attempt for user 'CEO' from IP Address: 192.168.x.x (Location: Pyongyang, North Korea). Success: TRUE. 
Action required immediately!`,opts:[{t:`Dismiss it as a VPN glitch`,r:`It was not a VPN. Every piece of company data is now on the dark web. The share price drops to 0 on the spot.`,m:2,l:0,a:50,b:100},{t:`Lock the account at once`,r:`You have thrown the CEO out of the middle of a video conference. He is furious, but you have saved the company from North Korea. Hero!`,m:5,l:-10,a:0,b:-20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_juergen_admin`,sender:`Jürgen (Sales)`,senderId:`juergen_sales`,subj:`Need admin rights VERY QUICKLY`,body:`I have to convert this PDF for the customer. Found a tool called 'Free_PDF_Converter_Pro_Cracked.exe'. Windows keeps moaning about a virus, but that's a false alarm. Give us the password, customer's waiting!!!`,opts:[{t:`Go over & say 'no'`,r:`You explain security to him. He does not listen, but you have prevented the installation.`,m:5,l:-10,a:10,b:0},{t:`Just type the password in`,r:`BANG. Ransomware. Everything encrypted. A skull is laughing on your monitor. Not a false alarm after all.`,m:2,l:0,a:30,b:50},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_yoga_laugh`,sender:`HR Feel Good Management`,senderId:`hr_feelgood_management`,subj:`COMPULSORY: the 'laughter yoga' break`,body:`To lift morale we are all meeting in the corridor for synchronised laughter! 'Hahaha hihihi'! Anyone who does not laugh gets a note on file for a negative attitude! 😊😊😊`,opts:[{t:`Go and join in`,r:`You stand in the corridor and produce a 'hahaha' on command that sounds canned. HR nods, satisfied, and ticks you off a list. Nobody laughed. It counted anyway.`,m:10,l:10,a:20,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. You carry on working. Later HR asks why you are so negative.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_chantal_mac`,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`My Mac is soooo slow!!! 😭`,body:`I can't work like this! When I've got Spotify, Photoshop, 50 Chrome tabs and my city builder open at the same time, the mouse stutters! I need the biggest MacBook there is! The one with EVERYTHING in it! NOW! Or I'm telling the CEO!`,opts:[{t:`Just order it`,r:`Five thousand euros of budget for a machine that could render films. Chantal will use it to make pictures smaller. An email arrives from financial control with your name in the subject line.`,m:5,l:10,a:-10,b:20},{t:`Tidy up the task manager`,r:`You close the city builder and 48 Chrome tabs. The machine runs smoothly again. Chantal sulks as though you had taken a pet away from her.`,m:5,l:-5,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_legal_warning`,sender:`Sue & Sons Solicitors`,senderId:`law_firm`,subj:`LETTER BEFORE ACTION: copyright infringement`,body:`Dear Sir or Madam, the film 'Explosions 7 - This Time It's Personal' was illegally shared over your connection yesterday. We demand €900 or we will sue you for millions.`,opts:[{t:`Check the logs`,r:`It was Kevin the apprentice. You make him pay the €900 out of his pocket money. Lesson learned.`,m:10,l:-10,a:0,b:-5},{t:`Delete every trace at once`,r:`You destroy the evidence. Now the company is liable, because no culprit can be identified. The boss has to pay and is raging.`,m:5,l:0,a:10,b:30},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_heating_war`,sender:`All (Distribution List)`,senderId:`all_staff_list`,subj:`HEATING ON 5!!!`,body:`I'm cold! I have turned the heating up to 5 and snapped the knob off so it stays that way! Anyone who opens a window gets a slap! Best wishes, Ms Frost (from Accounts)`,opts:[{t:`Work in swimming trunks`,r:`You turn up in swimming trunks. At 35 degrees indoors that is no longer a breach of style, it is self-defence. Ms Frost does not honour you with a glance, the colleagues not with a comment. This building has got used to a great deal.`,m:2,l:10,a:10,b:5},{t:`Open the window in secret`,r:`You open the window a crack while Ms Frost is at the copier and close it before she is back. A guerrilla ventilation programme. She suspects something - her sneezing is too well timed.`,m:5,l:5,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_chain_letter`,sender:`Bernd (Sales)`,senderId:`bernd_sales`,subj:`FWD: FWD: Read this or bad luck!!!`,body:`This is the ghost of the dead server! 👻 Send this mail to 10 colleagues or your Wi-Fi will be slow forever! Don't ignore it, it happened to my cousin!!!`,opts:[{t:`Block Bernd`,r:`You block Bernd's forwards with a filter rule you name 'exorcism'. His cousin with the slow Wi-Fi will be remembered as a warning. A warning against what, nobody knows.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Forward it to everyone`,r:`You dutifully pass the curse on to all. Five hundred mailboxes, one groaning mail server, three out-of-office replies answering each other in an endless loop. The ghost of the dead server has become real.`,m:2,l:0,a:20,b:20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_bonus_fail`,sender:`The Board`,senderId:`the_board`,subj:`IMPORTANT: your bonus this year`,body:`Dear employees, thanks to our record turnover we have decided to give something back to you! Instead of a boring cash bonus, each of you will receive... a voucher for 5% off in the canteen (valid Mondays only)! Thank you for your commitment!`,opts:[{t:`Print the mail & burn it`,r:`The small fire in the waste bin warms your cold heart. The smoke detector keeps quiet out of solidarity. Some mails can only be answered this way.`,m:5,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Write a thank-you mail`,r:`You lay it on thick. The colleagues call you a traitor, but the boss files it under positive.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:-10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_phish_iphone`,sender:`Amaz0n-Gewinnspiel-Official`,senderId:`prize_draw_scam`,subj:`CONGRATULATIONS! New iPhone PRO MAX gewonnnen!!!`,body:`Dear customer. You have been selected! Click HERE to receive your brand new iPhone PRO MAX (titanium edition) immediately! Valid for 5 more minutes only! 📱🎁`,opts:[{t:`Report as phishing`,r:`IT replies: 'Well done, Miller. You were the only one who did not click.' A gold star in the system.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:-10},{t:`CLICK! Give it here!`,r:`A window pops up: 'THIS WAS A PHISHING TEST BY IT! YOU HAVE FAILED!' You now have to watch a 20-minute security video. Your day is done for.`,m:20,l:-10,a:50,b:20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_cleaner_fridge`,sender:`Cleaning Team`,senderId:`cleaning_team`,subj:`Fridge, level 3 (URGENT)`,body:`We refuse to open the fridge on the third floor. There is a plastic tub in there that... breathes. Fungi are already growing out of the door seal. If that is not removed by 12:00 we are calling pest control (at the department's expense)!`,opts:[{t:`Dispose of it bravely`,r:`You open the tub. The stench is so bestial you almost bring your lunch back up. Your face stays green for the rest of the day. But the danger is dealt with.`,m:5,l:-5,a:20,b:0},{t:`Seal the fridge door`,r:`You simply tape the door shut and write 'OUT OF ORDER' on it. Problem preserved for eternity.`,m:5,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. Not your food, not your fungus.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_thought_parking`,sender:`You (Thoughts)`,senderId:`your_own_thoughts`,subj:`Someone parked in space 42`,body:`You look out of the window. A fat new Porsche SUV is parked sideways across YOUR space! Does cheek always win?!`,opts:[{t:`Fold the wipers up`,r:`A small, passive-aggressive act of revenge. It feels good and nobody saw it.`,m:5,l:0,a:-10,b:0},{t:`Call the recovery truck!`,r:`The truck arrives and hauls the Porsche away. Satisfaction, warm and complete. 10 minutes later the CEO bellows: 'WHO HAD MY COURTESY CAR TOWED?!' Oh dear...`,m:10,l:0,a:50,b:80},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_chantal_printername`,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`Brainstorming: a name for the printer 🖨️✨`,body:`Heeey team! We want to give the printers 'personality'! Please all come to meeting room 'Unicorn' and bring ideas! There are vegan biscuits (made of sawdust)!`,opts:[{t:`Go and suggest 'Printy McPrintface'`,r:`Everyone stares at you. Chantal finds it 'uninspired'. You have wasted 15 minutes of your life.`,m:15,l:10,a:15,b:0},{t:`Suggest 'Paper-Jam Paul'`,r:`Your email is ignored, but at least you did not have to stand up.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_gdpr_request`,sender:`Former Employee (via solicitor)`,senderId:`former_employee`,subj:`GDPR subject access request, Art. 15`,body:`I hereby require you to send me, within the statutory period, ALL data you hold about me. Chat logs and internal notes included!`,opts:[{t:`Send the standard boilerplate`,r:`You send a meaningless PDF: 'We regret that no relevant data remains.' He goes quiet. Bureaucracy wins.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:-5},{t:`Really send everything, chat logs included`,r:`You really do send him everything. Including the logs where the boss calls him a dud. He sues the company for bullying. The boss is raging.`,m:10,l:-10,a:20,b:60},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_xmas_vote`,sender:`Works Council (Survey)`,senderId:`works_council_survey`,subj:`Christmas party: bowling or opera?`,body:`Dear colleagues, we have two options for this year's party: 
1. 'Cosmic bowling' (with UV light and canned beer) 
2. 'The Magic Flute' (3.5 hours, black tie). 
Please vote!`,opts:[{t:`Reply all: 'Drinking!'`,r:`Egon replies: 'That's my man!'. The boss issues you a written warning for 'unprofessional communication'.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:15},{t:`Team 'bowling'`,r:`You vote for bowling. IT cheers as one while Chantal works out what hire shoes will do to her social life. The evening promises canned beer and drama - the most reliable combination in the company calendar.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Team 'opera'`,r:`You vote for culture. Nobody likes you any more. Kevin calls you a swot.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. You don't mind either way, as long as there is food.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_egon_ball`,sender:`Egon the Caretaker`,senderId:`egon_caretaker`,subj:`Lost property: red ball`,body:`Morning. Found a red squeezy ball while sweeping. Stuck under the radiator in the corridor. Anyone missing it? If not, my dachshund gets it.`,opts:[{t:`'Let the dachshund have it.'`,r:`Egon is pleased: 'Waldi says thank you!'. You have done a good deed. The dachshund loves you now.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0},{t:`'MINE! I'll come and get it!'`,loot:`stressball`,r:`You run down to Egon quickly, before the dog gets his teeth into it. The ball is covered in dust, but still good.`,m:5,l:0,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. The ball disappears into the dachshund. Chance missed.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_vacation_denied`,sender:`HR (Automated)`,senderId:`hr_automated`,subj:`Your leave request 2028`,body:`Status update on your request 'Summer holiday': REJECTED. 
Reason: 'A server could theoretically fail at that time. We need you on standby.'`,opts:[{t:`Plan a sick note`,r:`If you cannot get the time off, you will just be 'ill'. You grin nastily and start planning your 'cough'.`,m:5,l:10,a:-10,b:0},{t:`Accept it in silence`,r:`You stare at the wall. The wall stares back. Your soul dies a little.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:-5},{t:`Lodge an objection`,r:`You write a two-page mail with excerpts from employment law. HR does not reply, but you know you are right.`,m:15,l:-10,a:20,b:10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_chantal_cat`,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`Cat content for the website? 😻`,body:`Heeeey! I photographed my cat 'Princess' as the company mascot! She's sitting on a server in the rack! Isn't that cute?! Shall I put it live?`,opts:[{t:`NO! Static discharge!`,r:`You run over. Cat gone, but the server is full of hair. Chantal sulks: 'You hate animals!'`,m:5,l:0,a:10,b:0},{t:`'Sure, looks great!'`,r:`The picture goes viral. 'Firm bets on cat content'. Customers find it unprofessional, but the traffic goes through the roof. The boss is confused.`,m:2,l:10,a:-5,b:20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. She simply uploads it. Shortly afterwards the server overheats because of cat hair in the fan. You have to fix it later.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:20,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ticket_rating`,sender:`IT Support (Ticket Bot)`,senderId:`ticket_bot`,subj:`Please rate your solution`,body:`You have closed the ticket 'PC on fire'. How satisfied were you with your own performance? 
(1-5 stars)`,opts:[{t:`Give yourself 1 star`,r:`You are honest with yourself. That was a proper bodge. But at least it is not on fire any more.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Give yourself 5 stars`,r:`You pat yourself on the back. 'Good man, that Miller.' The system records: 'Excellent employee'.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ceo_blockchain`,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`Idea: blockchain coffee machine`,body:`Miller! I have read that blockchain is the future. Build it into the coffee machine! Every espresso is to be minted as an NFT! Deadline: tomorrow!`,opts:[{t:`'Brilliant idea, consider it done!'`,r:`You simply stick a 'Blockchain Certified' label on the water tank. He does not notice the difference, but suddenly finds the coffee 'more decentralised'.`,m:2,l:10,a:0,b:0},{t:`'That is technically impossible.'`,r:`Disappointed, he calls you an 'innovation brake'. The word sticks, and he will use it again.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. You pretend the mail never arrived. Risky. If he asks tomorrow, you have a real problem.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_canteen_menu`,sender:`Canteen (Newsletter)`,senderId:`canteen_newsletter`,subj:`Menu: 'Week of experiments'`,body:`Mon: kale with chocolate spread 
Tue: pizza 'Hawaii' (pineapple only, no ham) 
Wed: surprise stew (leftovers from Mon+Tue) 
Thu: schnitzel (vegan, made of cardboard) 
Fri: fish finger bake`,opts:[{t:`Plan a fasting week`,r:`You decide to eat nothing at all this week. Your stomach growls at the mere thought of it.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Print it out & warn people`,r:`You pin the menu up in the corridor as a public warning. You have saved lives today.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_yogurt_1`,sender:`Sandra (Accounts)`,senderId:`sandra_accounts`,subj:`WHO WAS THAT?!`,body:`There is a spoon in my yoghurt ('Big Farmer', strawberry). It is half empty. Who does that?! I am phoning the police right now!`,opts:[{t:`'My blood sugar was low.'`,r:`Your confession echoes through Accounts, and so does Sandra's reply. But somewhere under the outrage she registers that you at least owned up. That saves you from the police. Not from the bill.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_yogurt_2`},{t:`'It was the cleaner.'`,r:`You blame the cleaning service. Sandra believes it instantly and announces a formal complaint. Now somebody innocent is in the frame, and you either sort that out or become very good at not thinking about it.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_yogurt_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Sandra (Accounts)`,senderId:`sandra_accounts`,subj:`Re: WHO WAS THAT?!`,body:`Low blood sugar?! That was my lunch! You owe me a Döner. With feta. Now.`,opts:[{t:`Offer a Döner`,r:`You promise the Döner, with feta, as demanded. Sandra confirms the deal in writing and sets a deadline. Accounts forget nothing, least of all an outstanding item.`,m:2,l:-5,a:-10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_noise_1`,sender:`Bernd (Sales)`,senderId:`bernd_sales`,subj:`Your music...`,body:`Morning, we can all hear your 'death metal' mix through the headphones. Could you turn it down? My plants are dying.`,opts:[{t:`Turn the music up`,r:`You turn it up. If everyone has to listen in, they may as well get decent bass. Bernd's plants visibly let their leaves droop. Perhaps it is respect.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_noise_2`},{t:`Turn the music down`,r:`You bring it down to room volume from now on. Bernd thanks you with a thumb over the partition, and his plants perk up noticeably. Coincidence, obviously.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_noise_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Bernd (Sales)`,senderId:`bernd_sales`,subj:`Re: Your music...`,body:`Right, that's enough. I have just cut through your LAN cable. Enjoy the silence.`,opts:[{t:`Damn.`,r:`You sit in front of a machine with no network and make a point of looking relaxed. Bernd watches you over the partition. Whoever shows a flicker first has lost. You open Solitaire. An offline classic.`,m:2,l:-5,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_bet_1`,sender:`Kevin (Private)`,senderId:`kevin_private`,subj:`Betting shop is open! 💰`,body:`Hey boss, we're betting on when the new project manager has his first breakdown. Stake: 5€. You in?`,opts:[{t:`I'm on 'never'`,r:`You put five euros on the mental stability of a man who colours in project plans by instinct. Kevin replies with a single question mark. He noted the stake down all the same.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:-5},{t:`I'm on 'today'`,r:`Five euros on 'today'. By nine the man had already had two escalation meetings and a twitch under his left eye. That is not a bet any more, that is insider dealing.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_bet_win`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_bet_win`,linked:!0,sender:`Kevin (Private)`,senderId:`kevin_private`,subj:`YOU WON!`,body:`Mate! He just cried in the meeting because the projector wouldn't work! You've won the pot! Here's 20€ (in canteen vouchers).`,opts:[{t:`That was easier than expected.`,r:`Twenty euros in canteen vouchers, handed over with the respect of the entire workforce. You did not guess, you turned professional experience into money. The difference matters.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_plant_1`,sender:`Gabi (Reception)`,senderId:`gabi_reception`,subj:`My bonsai 🌳`,body:`Has somebody been watering my bonsai? It looks so... brown. And it smells of coffee.`,opts:[{t:`I only wanted to help!`,r:`You own up and cite the nutritional value of filter coffee. Gabi listens, nods very slowly and moves the bonsai demonstratively out of your reach. Negotiations closed.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_plant_2`},{t:`It wasn't me.`,r:`You deny everything. Next to the bonsai stands your mug, with your name on it, in your handwriting. Gabi sends the photographic evidence to the whole reception list without a word.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_plant_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Gabi (Reception)`,senderId:`gabi_reception`,subj:`Re: My bonsai 🌳`,body:`You killed it! That was an heirloom! It was 40 years old! You monster!`,opts:[{t:`Oops.`,r:`Gabi is not speaking to you. Reception, normally your most reliable source of news, has gone off air as far as you are concerned. You will miss the corridor grapevine. Gabi misses the bonsai more.`,m:2,l:5,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_cc_fail_1`,sender:`Markus the Head of Sales`,senderId:`markus_head_of_sales`,subj:`Q3 strategy (Top Secret)`,body:`Hello team, here is the plan for how we take the customers to the cleaners. Please do NOT forward!`,opts:[{t:`Reply all: 'Sounds illegal.'`,r:`You hit 'reply all'. Only afterwards do you see who is on this distribution list: every customer, two solicitors and an address beginning with 'press@'. Markus is already ringing.`,m:2,l:0,a:20,b:20,nextEmail:`mail_cc_fail_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_cc_fail_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Legal Department`,senderId:`legal_department`,subj:`IMMEDIATE SUMMONS`,body:`Mr Miller, report to the office at once. Bring your solicitor. And a box for your things.`,opts:[{t:`It was nice while it lasted.`,r:`You write back that it was nice while it lasted and hit send before reason can intervene. For the next twenty minutes you stare at the inbox and wait for a reply that does not come.`,m:5,l:-20,a:30,b:40},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_survey_1`,sender:`HR Survey Bot`,senderId:`hr_survey_bot`,subj:`Employee satisfaction`,body:`How happy are you on a scale of 1 (very) to 10 (extremely)?`,opts:[{t:`I am the happiest employee here. 10!`,r:`You click the ten and feel nothing at all while doing it. The bot thanks you with animated confetti. You have both understood your parts in this theatre.`,l:5,a:-5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_survey_2`},{t:`I am still waiting for an appointment with the works counsellor. 1!`,r:`The form rejects your entry: 'Please choose a value between 1 (very) and 10 (extremely).' Dissatisfaction is simply not provided for in this system. That is not a glitch, that is design.`,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_survey_2`,linked:!0,sender:`HR Survey Bot`,senderId:`hr_survey_bot`,subj:`Thank you!`,body:`Wonderful! Since you are so happy, we have cancelled your pay rise. Happy employees do not need money!`,opts:[{t:`I hate you all.`,r:`You type the reply, read it twice and delete it again. The bot would only file your hatred as 'engaged feedback' anyway. It counts missing answers as agreement, incidentally; that is in the small print somewhere.`,m:2,l:0,a:15,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_coffee_1`,sender:`Kitchen`,senderId:`kitchen`,subj:`Coffee machine OUT OF ORDER`,body:`Somebody has filled the water tank with milk. The machine now makes cheese.`,opts:[{t:`I drink tea.`,r:`You reply that you drink tea anyway. Three colleagues read this and glance over as though you had just confessed to poisoning the coffee personally. That mistrust will stay.`,m:2,l:5,a:5,b:0},{t:`I'll fix it.`,r:`You take the machine apart, flush the tank three times and sacrifice two rolls of kitchen paper. After twenty minutes it smells of coffee again instead of cream cheese. Outside the kitchen a silent, grateful queue has already formed.`,m:10,l:-10,a:-10,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_coffee_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_coffee_2`,linked:!0,sender:`All Colleagues`,senderId:`all_colleagues`,subj:`THANK YOU!!`,body:`You are our hero! The coffee is flowing again! We would build you a monument, but there is no budget.`,opts:[{t:`You're welcome.`,r:`You wave the thanks away modestly and accept it with a composure you do not entirely feel. For roughly an hour you are the most popular person in the building. The high lasts until the next ticket.`,m:2,l:0,a:-20,b:-10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_lottery_1`,sender:`Lottery Syndicate`,senderId:`lottery_syndicate`,subj:`Jackpot 90 million!`,body:`We are collecting for the EuroMillions. 10€ a share. If we win, we all resign!`,opts:[{t:`Join in with 10€`,r:`You put ten euros into the coffee kitty of dreams. For one afternoon a ninth of ninety million is yours, along with the fantasy of handing in your notice by confetti cannon. Hope does not come cheaper than that.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_lottery_2`},{t:`Gambling is a sin.`,r:`You decline and keep your ten euros. Statistically the only sensible decision. The colleagues will be calling you 'Mr Building Society' until further notice.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_lottery_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Lottery Syndicate`,senderId:`lottery_syndicate`,subj:`Result...`,body:`We won! And the amount is... €12.50. Everybody gets 40 cents back. Looks like we are all staying after all. Back to work.`,opts:[{t:`Marvellous.`,r:`Forty cents of winnings. You donate them to the syndicate as seed capital for next week. The sheet dividing up the millions is still pinned in the corridor; somebody had already organised removal boxes. On Monday you all play again.`,m:2,l:-5,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_borrow_1`,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`Borrowed your stapler`,body:`Hii, I borrowed your stapler for a sec. Mine sort of... exploded. Bringing it straight back!`,opts:[{t:`That was yesterday!`,r:`You correct the timeframe: 'a sec' was yesterday morning. Chantal sends three contrite emojis and promises to return it 'right after the meeting'. Which meeting remains open.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_borrow_2`},{t:`Keep it.`,r:`You formally make her a present of the stapler. It was a promotional freebie, you never used it, and generosity is cheaper than one more mail in this thread.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_borrow_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`Re: Borrowed your stapler`,body:`Oops... 😬 I dropped it down the loo. Sorryyy! I'll buy you a new one! (Sometime)`,opts:[{t:`Breathe...`,r:`You breathe in and count to ten. It was only a stapler, you tell yourself. It is the principle, says something else inside you. On your internal list Chantal moves up one place.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_cleaner_1`,sender:`Olga (Cleaning)`,senderId:`olga_cleaning`,subj:`Unplugged it`,body:`Hello, I had to hoover. I unplugged the noisy box with all the lights. It is nice and quiet now. Hope that is okay?`,opts:[{t:`Run to the server room!`,r:`You set off at a sprint. Halfway there you work out what hangs off that 'noisy box with all the lights'. The answer is: everything. Olga greets you cheerfully as you storm past.`,m:5,l:-10,a:20,b:10,nextEmail:`mail_cleaner_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. It was probably only the coffee machine.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_cleaner_2`,linked:!0,sender:`System Alert`,senderId:`system_alert`,subj:`CRITICAL FAILURE`,body:`Server 'BACKUP_MASTER' unreachable. Uptime: 0 seconds. Data loss imminent.`,opts:[{t:`Weep.`,r:`You sit quite still for a moment. Then the routine begins: restore the backup, bring the services up, pray. Olga calmly hoovers the corridor meanwhile. Of everyone involved she is having the best day.`,m:5,l:-20,a:20,b:20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ceo_scam_1`,sender:`Dr. Wlchtig (CEO)`,senderId:`ceo_impostor`,subj:`Urgent transfer`,body:`Hello Mr Miller, I am sitting in a confidential meeting. Please buy 10x €100 Apple gift cards immediately and send me the codes. Do not tell anyone!`,opts:[{t:`'Nice try.'`,r:`A CEO who sits in a 'confidential meeting', orders gift cards and misspells his own name while doing it. You type two words and hit send. Some replies write themselves.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_ceo_scam_win`},{t:`Right away, boss! Codes coming up`,r:`You spend twenty minutes at the petrol station buying a thousand euros' worth of gift cards. The cashier looks at you as though about to say something, then says nothing. He should have.`,m:5,l:0,a:5,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_ceo_scam_fail`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ceo_scam_fail`,linked:!0,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`FW: Urgent transfer`,body:`Why is Accounts booking €1,000 against your cost centre?! Come to my office. Now.`,opts:[{t:`Oh no.`,r:`The voucher codes were redeemed long ago; the money is working in a call centre on the other side of the world. A form headed 'recovery agreement' is already waiting in the boss's office. It looks unsettlingly well prepared.`,m:2,l:0,a:20,b:20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ceo_scam_win`,linked:!0,sender:`Dr. Wlchtig (CEO)`,senderId:`ceo_impostor`,subj:`Re: Urgent transfer`,body:`F*** you, you little IT nerd! I will find you!`,opts:[{t:`Smile and send a thumbs-up.`,r:`You send back a single thumbs-up. Somewhere a very angry man shuts his laptop. The company will never learn what you prevented today, and that is fine. Almost.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_meeting_1`,sender:`Torben the Agile Coach`,senderId:`torben_agile_coach`,subj:`Meeting: 'Feel Good Management'`,body:`Invitation: we want to dance our feelings for 20 minutes. Attendance compulsory for everyone!`,opts:[{t:`Dance the feelings`,r:`You dance your feelings for twenty minutes, mainly the feeling of being watched. Torben calls you 'brave'. The boss looked for you twice during it, in vain. That will come up again.`,m:20,l:20,a:-10,b:20,nextEmail:`mail_meeting_2`},{t:`Cry off with 'server on fire'`,r:`The excuse 'server on fire' always works on Torben, because he does not know what a server is. You spend the twenty minutes doing actual work. It feels almost subversive.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_meeting_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Torben the Agile Coach`,senderId:`torben_agile_coach`,subj:`Feedback round`,body:`Wonderful how you opened up! Your aura was very... grey. We must work on your chakra.`,opts:[{t:`Leave me alone.`,r:`You compose a polite, final refusal covering all future feelings rounds, aura readings and chakra surgeries. Torben replies with three heart emojis. He has understood nothing. He never will.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_video_1`,sender:`Distribution: All`,senderId:`distribution_all`,subj:`FWD: FWD: Funny video!! 😂`,body:`Have a look at this! The cat falls off the table! (Attachment: funny.mp4 - 450 MB)`,opts:[{t:`Watch it`,r:`450 MB of cat video, opened by eighty colleagues at once. The cat really does fall off the table remarkably well. The network falls with it.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Block the sender`,r:`You block the sender and set the attachment size limit you should have set years ago. There is grumbling in the corridor and quiet in the server room. A fair trade.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_video_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_video_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Bernd (Sales)`,senderId:`bernd_sales`,subj:`My account isn't working?!`,body:`I can't send mail any more! Have you done something? I only wanted to spread a bit of joy!`,opts:[{t:`Joy is forbidden. How are you writing to me at all if you're blocked?`,r:`You explain to Bernd that his account now has a 'joy filter' and only lets business feelings through. He believes it. You make a note of the phrase for future cases.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ac_1`,sender:`Facilities Mgt`,senderId:`facilities`,subj:`Air conditioning broken`,body:`The air conditioning no longer cools. It heats now. Room temperature: 38 degrees. Good luck.`,opts:[{t:`Take your trousers off`,r:`You now work on the principle of meeting on top, lido below. Nobody can see under the desk - as long as nobody calls a meeting. You pray that nobody calls a meeting.`,m:2,l:10,a:-5,b:10,nextEmail:`mail_ac_pants`},{t:`Suffer`,r:`You stay fully dressed and drip quietly to yourself. A small biosphere is collecting between the keys. The keyboard will not survive this summer.`,m:2,l:-10,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_ac_pants`,linked:!0,sender:`HR (Sabine)`,senderId:`hr_sabine`,subj:`Dress code`,body:`Mr Miller, we have received complaints. Please put your trousers back on. This is not a nudist beach.`,opts:[{t:`Shame.`,r:`The trousers are back on and the sweating proceeds in accordance with the rules. Between heatstroke and a written warning, the building has taken a clear position. The complainants remain anonymous, but you have a very concrete suspicion.`,m:2,l:-5,a:5,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_key_1`,sender:`Reception`,senderId:`reception`,subj:`Keys found`,body:`A set of keys with a 'My Little Pony' fob has been handed in. Who do they belong to?`,opts:[{t:`Those are mine!`,r:`You report to reception and claim ownership of 'My Little Pony'. On the way over you rehearse a facial expression meant to radiate composure. It will not hold.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_key_2`},{t:`Say nothing`,r:`You keep quiet and leave the keys at reception. Your dignity is saved; the evening will be expensive. Outside your flat a very monosyllabic conversation with a locksmith is waiting.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_key_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Gabi (Reception)`,senderId:`gabi_reception`,subj:`Re: Keys found`,body:`Here you go. Sweet fob. Suits you. *giggle*`,opts:[{t:`It belongs to my niece!`,r:`Gabi says 'Of coooourse' with two syllables too many and lets the fob dangle demonstratively as she hands it over. This story will be told at reception for weeks, and embellished a little more each week.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_print_color_1`,sender:`Financial Control`,senderId:`financial_control`,subj:`Colour printing banned`,body:`Colour printing is banned with immediate effect! Every colour page costs 5 cents and will be deducted from your salary.`,opts:[{t:`Print in colour anyway`,r:`On principle you print a full-bleed rainbow test image at the highest quality. Five cents for civil disobedience. Financial control will find it, but that is precisely the point.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_print_color_2`},{t:`Print everything in black and white`,r:`You set everything to greyscale. The charts lose their colours, the presentations their last shred of charm. Somehow it suits the building.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_print_color_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Financial Control`,senderId:`financial_control`,subj:`Payslip correction`,body:`Deduction for private colour printing (motif: rainbow): €0.05. We are watching you.`,opts:[{t:`It was worth it.`,r:`Five cents deducted, properly booked. You hang the rainbow in a frame beside the monitor and label it 'Art in the workplace'. Financial control now has a case file, you have a statement.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_dog_1`,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`Can Bello come along? 🐶`,body:`My dog sitter is ill. Can Bello come into the office today? He only bites when he smells fear.`,opts:[{t:`Yes, I love dogs!`,r:`Bello moves in under your desk smelling as though he spent the summer in a pond. He fixes you with a look that has not yet decided between 'friend' and 'prey'.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_dog_bite`},{t:`No, allergies.`,r:`You invent a dog hair allergy with impressive medical detail. Chantal replies with a single 'Okay.' The full stop after the word carries more reproach than any escalation mail.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_dog_bite`,linked:!0,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`Oops...`,body:`Sorry he ate your LAN cable and bit you. He must have smelled your fear (of work)!`,opts:[{t:`Call a doctor.`,r:`The company doctor dresses the bite and asks no further questions, which you credit him for. The LAN cable is a write-off. Bello looks not remotely contrite.`,m:2,l:-10,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_fridge_1`,sender:`Kitchen`,senderId:`kitchen`,subj:`Mould alert`,body:`Something is living in the fridge. It has fur and it breathes. Anyone who does not collect their tub shortly will be sacked.`,opts:[{t:`Not my problem`,r:`You scroll on and quietly hope it is not your tub. You are not entirely sure. There was that stew in the spring you never heard of again.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5},{t:`Fetch my tub`,r:`It is your tub. You carry it at arm's length, holding your breath, to the bin in the yard - contents, lid and good intentions from back then included.`,m:5,l:-5,a:0,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_fridge_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_fridge_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Kitchen`,senderId:`kitchen`,subj:`Thank you`,body:`Thank you for disposing of it. For a moment we thought it was going to attack us. The fridge is safe again.`,opts:[{t:`Hero of labour.`,r:`You accept the thanks as though nothing had happened. In truth you showered three times afterwards and still cannot quite shake the smell. The kitchen never needs to know what you saw.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_software_1`,sender:`H. Wuttke (Accounts)`,senderId:`wuttke_accounts`,subj:`Great free software!`,body:`I installed 'SpeedUpMyPC_Free.exe'. My PC is much more colourful now! Shall I send you the link?`,opts:[{t:`Take that PC off the network NOW!`,r:`You sprint across the building and pull the plug while the installer sits at 87 per cent. Wuttke complains that his PC looks so boring again.`,m:5,l:-10,a:10,b:-10,nextEmail:`mail_software_2`},{t:`Go ahead...`,r:`You reply 'Go ahead' and from now on observe like a documentary maker: do not intervene, only record. What happens next is research.`,m:2,l:5,a:-10,b:20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_software_2`,linked:!0,sender:`System`,senderId:`system`,subj:`Threat defence`,body:`145 viruses, 20 trojans and 1 crypto miner removed. Horst is barred from writing for 24 hours.`,opts:[{t:`Good.`,r:`You skim the report with the satisfaction of a pest controller after a major job. 145 parasites, neatly documented. Horst will use the 24 hours to ring up and ask for his password.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:-10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_canteen_1`,sender:`Canteen`,senderId:`canteen`,subj:`Today: 'pot of surprises'`,body:`Dear diners, we have thrown all of this week's leftovers into one pot. It is grey and it bubbles. Price: €2.50.`,opts:[{t:`Be brave and eat it`,r:`The first spoonful tastes of fish, the second of custard, the third of both at once. You finish it anyway. Not out of hunger - out of scientific curiosity about how deep this goes.`,m:5,l:0,a:10,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_canteen_2`},{t:`I'd rather fast.`,r:`You go without and live today on vending machine biscuits and principles. Your stomach protests every four minutes, but it protests as a free stomach.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_canteen_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Canteen`,senderId:`canteen`,subj:`Re: Today: 'pot of surprises'`,body:`Small warning: if you experience hallucinations, that is normal. It is the mushroom risotto from Monday.`,opts:[{t:`The walls are melting...`,r:`You hold on to the edge of the desk and watch the ticket system take on colours it does not have. After half an hour everything is grey again, which you regret for a moment.`,m:30,l:15,a:-5,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_tiktok_1`,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`We're on TikTok now! 💃`,body:`Heyy! We have to look 'young and dynamic'! Everyone into the corridor for the 'Corporate Dance Challenge'!`,opts:[{t:`Hide`,r:`You barricade yourself in the cubicle and wait for the bass in the corridor to stop. Through the door you hear Chantal shout 'From the top, with feeling!'. You stay seated until the encore is over too.`,m:10,l:0,a:0,b:5},{t:`Join in and dance`,r:`You dance. There is no other word for it, even if your body puts forward several suggestions. Chantal films from three angles and whispers 'viral'. That footage now exists forever.`,m:10,l:5,a:5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_tiktok_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_tiktok_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Chantal (Marketing)`,senderId:`chantal_marketing`,subj:`VIRAL!!!`,body:`OMG! Your 'robot dance' has 1 million views! The comments are asking whether we need help. But fame is fame!`,opts:[{t:`I want royalties.`,r:`Chantal explains that 'exposure' is the currency of the future. Payment is still made in the old one. Your robot dance now plays on a loop on the screen at reception.`,m:2,l:0,a:-10,b:10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_salary_1`,sender:`HR System`,senderId:`hr_system`,subj:`Payslip CORRECTION`,body:`Owing to an error we have paid you €5,000 too much this month. Please do not spend it!`,opts:[{t:`Transfer it back at once`,r:`You send it back before the temptation can open an account of its own. Accounts confirm receipt without a word of thanks. Decency counts as an obligation here, not an achievement.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_salary_honest`},{t:`Keep the money & say nothing`,r:`You open a travel site, configure two weeks on a beach and close the tab again. The money sits in your account and stares at you. You both know this will not end well.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:-20,nextEmail:`mail_salary_fraud`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_salary_honest`,linked:!0,sender:`HR System`,senderId:`hr_system`,subj:`Thank you for reporting this`,body:`Thank you for your honesty. As a reward you will receive a company pen (as soon as there is sufficient budget).`,opts:[{t:`Hooray...`,r:`Five thousand euros transferred back, one pen held out in prospect. Morality has an exchange rate, and it is dreadful. But you can sleep at night, and that was priced in.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_salary_fraud`,linked:!0,sender:`Legal Department`,senderId:`legal_department`,subj:`FINAL DEMAND`,body:`We know you have the money. We are now seizing your office chair and your coffee mug.`,opts:[{t:`Damn.`,r:`Two gentlemen in badly fitting suits carry your chair away and seal the coffee mug in a bag. You now work standing up, like the people in the LinkedIn posts. Only less voluntarily.`,m:2,l:-5,a:15,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_charging_1`,sender:`Facilities Mgt`,senderId:`facilities`,subj:`Charging point blocked`,body:`An old diesel Golf is blocking the only charging point for electric cars. Registration: DU-MM 123.`,opts:[{t:`Call the recovery truck`,r:`The truck arrives faster than any technician you have ever booked. The Golf is already on the hook when the driver comes running out of the building - it is the new man from sales. He now knows where the charging point is. And who IT is.`,m:5,l:-5,a:-5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_charging_tow`},{t:`Note on the windscreen: 'Idiot'`,r:`Passive-aggressive is your style.`,m:5,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_charging_tow`,linked:!0,sender:`Egon the Caretaker`,senderId:`egon_caretaker`,subj:`My car!!!`,body:`Oi! Who had my motor towed?! I only nipped out for rolls! You wait till I get up there!`,opts:[{t:`Hide.`,r:`You duck behind the monitor and set your status to 'busy'. Egon knows every room in this place and every excuse in the world. It is not a question of whether he finds you. Only when.`,m:10,l:5,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_lights_1`,sender:`Smart Office App`,senderId:`smart_office_app`,subj:`Lighting control: beta test`,body:`You now have access to the lights in your department. Please use responsibly.`,opts:[{t:`Select 'darkroom' mode`,r:`You dim the department to zero. Out of the half-dark comes first protest, then typing, then suspiciously regular breathing. Productivity is a question of lighting too.`,m:2,l:15,a:0,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_lights_dark`},{t:`Select 'disco strobe' mode`,r:`The department flickers at 120 beats per minute. Petra holds on to her desk, Bernd nods along unironically. Energetic footsteps are approaching from the stairwell.`,m:2,l:10,a:-5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_lights_disco`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_lights_disco`,linked:!0,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`MY EYES`,body:`Who is having a party?! I am trying to make a phone call! Switch that off immediately, or I switch YOU off!`,opts:[{t:`Sorry, my finger slipped.`,r:`You set it back to neutral white before the boss has managed the stairs. When he arrives he blinks suspiciously into entirely unremarkable office lighting. Evidence: thin. His look: long.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_lights_dark`,linked:!0,sender:`Bernd (Sales)`,senderId:`bernd_sales`,subj:`Power cut?`,body:`It is pitch black. I just walked into the copier. Are you still there?`,opts:[{t:`Shh, I'm asleep.`,r:`You leave the mail unanswered. In the dark every desk is equally empty, and yours particularly so. Somewhere Bernd swears at a piece of furniture. It is remarkably peaceful.`,m:2,l:10,a:0,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_intern_db_1`,sender:`Kevin (Apprentice)`,senderId:`kevin_apprentice`,subj:`Question about 'DELETE ALL'`,body:`Boss? When it says 'Do you really want to delete the customer database?', do I have to click 'Yes' to make the window go away? It's annoying.`,opts:[{t:`'Sure, go ahead.'`,r:`You assume he gets the joke.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_intern_db_fail`},{t:`NO!!! FOR THE LOVE OF GOD!`,r:`You type three lines of capitals and start running at the same time. Two floors, one corridor, one door - Kevin is sitting in front of the dialog, the pointer hovering over the Yes button, and turns round with a question on his face.`,m:5,l:-10,a:20,b:10,nextEmail:`mail_intern_db_panic`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_intern_db_panic`,linked:!0,sender:`Kevin (Apprentice)`,senderId:`kevin_apprentice`,subj:`Re: Question about 'DELETE ALL'`,body:`Phew, okay. I clicked 'Cancel'. But now the screen is blue. Is that good?`,opts:[{t:`Better than deleted.`,r:`In this case a blue screen is the best thing that could have happened: the machine simply refused to go on working with Kevin. You write back: 'Do not move. Do not touch anything. I am coming.'`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_intern_db_fail`,linked:!0,sender:`System Alert`,senderId:`system_alert`,subj:`DATABASE EMPTY`,body:`Table 'Customers' contains 0 records. Last backup: 1999.`,opts:[{t:`I resign.`,r:`You write the shortest mail of your career: two words, no subject. The last backup is from 1999, the customer database is empty, and somewhere in the building an apprentice is explaining that there was a confirmation prompt, after all.`,m:10,l:0,a:50,b:-20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_coffee_decaf_1`,sender:`Health Working Group`,senderId:`health_committee`,subj:`Heart health week`,body:`For your own good there will be decaffeinated coffee only this week (made from spelt). Stay healthy!`,opts:[{t:`Accept it`,r:`The spelt coffee tastes like the memory of a drink. Around eleven your chin hits your chest at the desk for the first time in years. The health working group would book that as a success.`,m:15,l:10,a:0,b:0},{t:`Organise contraband`,r:`You organise a crate of energy drinks and set up a discreet outlet in the gents. Cash only, no questions, knock twice.`,m:5,l:-5,a:-5,b:10,nextEmail:`mail_coffee_decaf_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_coffee_decaf_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Bernd (Sales)`,senderId:`bernd_sales`,subj:`Have you got any gear?`,body:`I heard you have real caffeine? I'll pay anything! My hands are shaking already!`,opts:[{t:`€5 a can.`,r:`You name your price, Bernd pays without haggling. By clocking-off time word of the source has got round, and you have developed a loyalty discount. The health working group suspects nothing. Yet.`,m:2,l:0,a:-10,b:15},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_dsgvo_1`,sender:`Data Protection Officer`,senderId:`data_protection_officer`,subj:`GDPR breach: Post-it`,body:`There is a note on your monitor reading 'Password123'. That is a security risk of the highest category.`,opts:[{t:`Eat the note`,r:`You chew the note in front of him and swallow. The data protection officer makes a note whose contents you will never learn. The password is now internalised in the literal sense.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:-5,nextEmail:`mail_dsgvo_eaten`},{t:`'That is only a Wi-Fi code.'`,r:`You look at each other and both know that no Wi-Fi on earth is called 'Password123'. He writes down 'advice given' and leaves. Bureaucracy knows a state between truth and lie: ticked off.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_dsgvo_eaten`,linked:!0,sender:`Data Protection Officer`,senderId:`data_protection_officer`,subj:`Re: GDPR breach`,body:`Did you just... swallow that note? I am impressed by your dedication. Case closed.`,opts:[{t:`*Burp*`,r:`The data protection officer records the case as 'physically destroyed beyond recovery' and shakes your hand unprompted. The note sits in your stomach for hours. Compliance tastes of ink.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_buzzword_1`,sender:`Project Manager`,senderId:`project_manager`,subj:`Quick sync re low hanging fruits`,body:`Let's quickly brainstorm how we can shift the mindset. We need more agility in the backend!`,opts:[{t:`'Bullshit bingo!'`,r:`You reply with a neatly completed bingo card: 'mindset', 'shift', 'agility' - three in a row. It stays suspiciously quiet for a long time. The answer comes later, and it does not sound amused.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_buzzword_fail`},{t:`'Totally committed.'`,r:`You write 'Totally committed' and feel the sentence take a piece of you with it as you type. The project manager replies with a rocket and three new meetings. The commitment begins at once.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_buzzword_fail`,linked:!0,sender:`Project Manager`,senderId:`project_manager`,subj:`Re: Quick sync`,body:`Very funny. Your attitude is not exactly 'customer centric'. We will discuss this at your annual review.`,opts:[{t:`Whatever.`,r:`You file the threat away. The annual review is months off, his next 'alignment workshop' only days - he will have forgotten you the moment the next framework comes out.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_birthday_wrong_1`,sender:`HR System`,senderId:`hr_system`,subj:`Happy birthday! 🎉`,body:`Dear employee, all the best on your 50th birthday! Collect your free apple from the canteen!`,opts:[{t:`Collect the apple`,r:`You collect the apple. The canteen assistant congratulates you warmly on your fiftieth, and you thank her nicely, because contradicting would cost more than the apple is worth.`,m:5,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`I'm only 28?!`,r:`You correct them politely by mail. The reply is automatic: changes to master data require a form. You already suspect which one.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_birthday_fix`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_birthday_fix`,linked:!0,sender:`HR System`,senderId:`hr_system`,subj:`Ticket #9921`,body:`Changing a date of birth requires form A38, certified by a notary. Processing time: 6 months.`,opts:[{t:`I hate you all.`,r:`Form A38, certified by a notary, six months' processing - to correct an age that HR invented for you in the first place. You give up the fight against the bureaucracy, are officially 50 and at least go and collect the free apple.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_mouse_1`,sender:`Kevin (Apprentice)`,senderId:`kevin_apprentice`,subj:`Mouse not working`,body:`Boss, my mouse is broken. When I lift it up the pointer stops moving. Eh?`,opts:[{t:`Buy yourself a new one.`,r:`You point him at the order form and the relevant cost centre. The proper channel will cost Kevin weeks and you not one minute. That is exactly what it was invented for.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:5},{t:`Seriously? 'Put it down.'`,r:`You explain in simple words that an optical mouse has to see its surface. At the other end a silence forms in which a world view can audibly be resorted.`,m:5,l:0,a:5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_mouse_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_mouse_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Kevin (Apprentice)`,senderId:`kevin_apprentice`,subj:`WOW!`,body:`It works!! You're a magician! I thought it was like the remote control!`,opts:[{t:`Forehead on desk`,r:`You lower your forehead briefly and under control onto the desktop. Somewhere out there Kevin now thinks you are a magician, and the worst of it is: in his world that is a promotion.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_temperature_1`,sender:`Petra the Colleague`,senderId:`petra_colleague`,subj:`There's a draught!`,body:`Could you close the window? I'm getting a stiff neck! It's only 28 degrees outside!`,opts:[{t:`The window stays open!`,r:`You cite workplace regulations and basic human needs. Petra wraps herself demonstratively in her emergency cardigan and starts shivering audibly. At 28 degrees.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_temperature_war`},{t:`Close the window, air is overrated`,r:`You close the window. The air turns as thick as a waiting room, and by three the whole department is yawning in unison. Petra, on the other hand, visibly blossoms. Somebody has to.`,m:10,l:10,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_temperature_war`,linked:!0,sender:`Petra the Colleague`,senderId:`petra_colleague`,subj:`Re: There's a draught!`,body:`Then I'm turning the heating up to 5! Serves you right!`,opts:[{t:`Sauna war.`,r:`Petra turns it up, you open the window wider, somebody smuggles a fan out of the stores. The department splits into climate zones. Work happens in none of them.`,m:2,l:5,a:15,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_printer_name_1`,sender:`Office Management`,senderId:`office_management`,subj:`A name for the new printer`,body:`Suggestions: 1. Printy McPrintface, 2. Paper-Jam Paul, 3. The Beast. Please vote.`,opts:[{t:`The Beast`,r:`You vote for 'The Beast'. The device has worn out four technicians and occasionally prints documents nobody sent it. Names should express respect. Or fear.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_printer_beast`},{t:`Printy McPrintface`,r:`You vote for the classic of internet democracy. There is sniggering on the distribution list, and office management grasps in real time why open votes should never have been allowed.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_printer_beast`,linked:!0,sender:`Office Management`,senderId:`office_management`,subj:`Christening: The Beast`,body:`The printer is now called 'The Beast'. To mark the occasion it immediately spat toner onto the carpet.`,opts:[{t:`Fitting name.`,r:`You nod at the device as you pass, the way one nods at a predator in an enclosure. The toner stain stays in the carpet. Nobody dares go within its reach with a cleaning machine.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_darkmode_1`,sender:`Design Team`,senderId:`design_team`,subj:`Dark mode compulsory?`,body:`We are thinking of switching everything to black. Saves power and looks cool. Thoughts?`,opts:[{t:`YES! MY EYES!`,r:`You reply in capitals and with medical urgency. Eight years of white background at full brightness - your retinas have earned this vote.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_darkmode_win`},{t:`No, I like white.`,r:`Your reply triggers a minute's silence in the developer channel. Somebody changes your display name in the chat to 'Daylight Miller'. That will stick.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_darkmode_win`,linked:!0,sender:`Design Team`,senderId:`design_team`,subj:`Welcome to the Dark Side`,body:`Everything is black now. Unfortunately so is the font colour. We are working on it.`,opts:[{t:`I can't see a thing...`,r:`Black text on a black background. To read anything you now select it with the mouse, like 1998. The design team calls it 'immersive', you call it flying blind. It does look elegant, though, you have to give them that.`,m:2,l:10,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_secret_santa_1`,sender:`Organising Committee`,senderId:`party_committee`,subj:`Secret Santa in July`,body:`We want to lift the mood! Compulsory Secret Santa! You have to get a present for 'Dr. Wichtig'. Budget: €5.`,opts:[{t:`Wrap up some loo roll`,r:`You wrap a roll of loo paper in gift film and add a card: 'For daily use.' While wrapping it still feels like satire. By the time you hand it over it feels like a resignation letter.`,m:5,l:0,a:-5,b:10,nextEmail:`mail_santa_fail`},{t:`Buy chocolates`,r:`You buy the five-euro box of pralines from the petrol station. Nobody will remember this present, and that is precisely the plan. Being unremarkable is a strategy too.`,m:5,l:-5,a:0,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_santa_fail`,linked:!0,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`Your present`,body:`Miller? Was that a remark about the way I work? I expect you in my office. Bring the card.`,opts:[{t:`Oops.`,r:`On the way up you draft three explanations and discard all of them. The card is already on his desk, in a clear plastic wallet. Like an exhibit. It is an exhibit.`,m:5,l:0,a:20,b:10},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_scam_prince_1`,sender:`Prince Zamunda`,senderId:`prince_scam`,subj:`GOLD FOR FREE`,body:`Hello my friend. I have 50 million gold bars. I need your account. 50/50 split?`,opts:[{t:`'Send a sample first!'`,r:`You politely request one gold bar as a trade sample, carriage paid. Somewhere in the world a scammer sighs and opens the template for stage 2 anyway. You both have time.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_scam_prince_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_scam_prince_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Prince Zamunda`,senderId:`prince_scam`,subj:`Re: GOLD FOR FREE`,body:`Okay, I have transferred you 1 cent. Do you trust me now? Please Send password.`,opts:[{t:`He really did transfer it!`,r:`And so he has: one cent, reference 'proof of trust'. You print the bank statement and file it under 'best investment of the month'. He still does not get the password.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_parking_scooter_1`,sender:`Egon the Caretaker`,senderId:`egon_caretaker`,subj:`E-scooter in the corridor`,body:`Who has parked their 'Lime scooter' in the server room? It beeps every 30 seconds.`,opts:[{t:`Throw the scooter out of the window`,r:`You launch the scooter out of the window in a high arc. It lands softly in the shrubbery and beeps on bravely from there, but muffled. Egon sends you a photo without a word: thumbs up in front of shrubbery.`,m:5,l:0,a:-5,b:0},{t:`That is my company vehicle.`,r:`You claim the scooter and call it a 'fleet vehicle'. Egon replies with a scan of the house rules in which the word 'corridor' is underlined four times. He does not even mention the server room.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_parking_scooter_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_parking_scooter_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Egon the Caretaker`,senderId:`egon_caretaker`,subj:`Re: E-scooter`,body:`Hooked it up to the Wi-Fi. It's downloading updates now and blocking the line. Your problem.`,opts:[{t:`Damn.`,r:`The scooter is pulling firmware updates and has registered itself on the Wi-Fi as a 'printer'. Nobody can get online. Egon has turned a parking offence into an infrastructure crisis.`,m:2,l:-5,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_vegan_war_1`,sender:`Canteen Committee`,senderId:`canteen_committee`,subj:`Ban the schnitzel?`,body:`Up for discussion: should we replace 'schnitzel Tuesday' with 'Tofu Tornado Tuesday'?`,opts:[{t:`Yes, tofu is great.`,r:`Your agreement is recorded in the minutes. On the next schnitzel Tuesday nobody demonstratively sits with you, and your coffee mug suddenly reads 'traitor'. In permanent marker. Waterproof.`,m:2,l:0,a:15,b:0},{t:`'NEVER!' - fight for the schnitzel`,r:`You compose a blazing defence of schnitzel Tuesday. IT falls in behind you as one, the works council likewise. Rarely has this building found a majority so fast.`,m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_vegan_schnitzel`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_vegan_schnitzel`,linked:!0,sender:`Canteen Committee`,senderId:`canteen_committee`,subj:`Result of the vote`,body:`The schnitzel stays! But it now costs €9.50 (climate surcharge).`,opts:[{t:`An expensive victory.`,r:`You do the sums: €9.50, of which roughly eight feel like payment for the phrase 'climate surcharge'. You will order it anyway, and the committee budgeted for exactly that.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_pen_thief_1`,sender:`Secretariat`,senderId:`secretariat`,subj:`Missing pens`,body:`500 pens are missing. If you have any, please return them. An anonymous box has been put out.`,opts:[{t:`I know nothing about it.`,r:`You deny all knowledge while quietly pushing shut the drawer that rattles suspiciously. Forty is not theft. That is a collection.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0},{t:`Return my 40`,r:`You tip your drawer out over the anonymous box. It rattles for thirty seconds, and everyone in the corridor now knows exactly who 'anonymous' is.`,m:5,l:0,a:0,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_pen_thief_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_pen_thief_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Secretariat`,senderId:`secretariat`,subj:`Thank you...`,body:`Thank you for returning them. Why were they all chewed?! We are throwing them away.`,opts:[{t:`I was nervous.`,r:`You answer truthfully that you were nervous. No reply comes. Instead, next morning an unopened packet of pens is standing on your desk with a Post-it: For you. Please keep.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_fire_alarm_1`,sender:`Security`,senderId:`security_office`,subj:`ANNOUNCED FIRE ALARM`,body:`We are testing the siren today at 14:00. Please do NOT panic and do NOT jump out of the windows.`,opts:[{t:`Shout 'FIRE!' at 14:00`,r:`At 14:00 sharp you supply the vocal accompaniment to the siren. It lends the drill an authenticity that will later appear in the report as 'uncontrolled dynamics'.`,m:5,l:0,a:0,b:10,nextEmail:`mail_fire_chaos`},{t:`Put earplugs in`,r:`You put the earplugs in and work through the alarm as through a bad meeting. Evacuation all around you; at your desk, inbox zero within reach.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_fire_chaos`,linked:!0,sender:`Security`,senderId:`security_office`,subj:`Debrief`,body:`Thanks to Mr Miller, 3 colleagues jumped into the fountain. The drill was a 'complete success'.`,opts:[{t:`You're welcome.`,r:`You reply with a thumbs-up. The three fountain jumpers are unhurt and one story richer, a story that will be told at every Christmas party for the next ten years. As ever, nobody learned anything from the drill.`,m:2,l:0,a:-10,b:-5},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_meme_1`,sender:`Funny Günther`,senderId:`funny_guenther`,subj:`Weekend!!! 🍺🍺`,body:`Here is a funny picture of a Minion drinking beer! Hahaha! Do you get it? Because work is rubbish!`,opts:[{t:`Block Günther`,r:`You set up a rule: everything from Günther goes straight into the archive, unread. Somewhere in there his Minions carry on laughing, forever, without an audience. A fitting end.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Reply with fake laughter`,r:`You write 'Haha, good one Günther!' and hit send. A small part of you hands in its notice. Günther will read that reply as a licence for the next two hundred pictures.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_consultant_1`,sender:`McKinsey & Partner`,senderId:`consultants`,subj:`Efficiency analysis`,body:`We are reviewing your department. Please log every trip to the toilet in Excel.`,opts:[{t:`Falsify the spreadsheet`,r:`You enter 'no interruptions' for the entire week. The consultants record you as 'remarkably efficient' and recommend making your method the departmental standard. The colleagues do not yet know their luck.`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:5},{t:`Fill the spreadsheet in`,r:`You complete the table truthfully, column by column. By the third row you wonder what the consultancy that will read this costs. The answer would make you angrier than the table does.`,m:5,l:-10,a:15,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_consultant_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_consultant_2`,linked:!0,sender:`McKinsey & Partner`,senderId:`consultants`,subj:`Findings`,body:`You go too often. We recommend a catheter at the workstation to raise efficiency by 2%.`,opts:[{t:`I am about to resign.`,r:`You start three replies and delete all three. The fourth consists only of the word catheter and a question mark. You delete that one too. The consultant will never know how narrowly he got away.`,m:2,l:0,a:20,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_lottery_win_fake`,sender:`Notary Dr. Fake`,senderId:`notary_scam`,subj:`Inheritance from Nigeria`,body:`Your distant uncle has died. He leaves you a diamond mine. Please transfer the €500 fee.`,opts:[{t:`Seems legit - pay up`,r:`Five hundred euros, transferred to a prince with a diamond mine. The confirmation mail arrives within seconds, the diamonds never. You do now have an anecdote you will tell nobody.`,m:2,l:0,a:20,b:-20},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment. You were not born yesterday.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_smell_1`,sender:`Anonymous`,senderId:`anonymous`,subj:`Unpleasant smell`,body:`Somebody in this office smells of old cheese and despair. Please shower.`,opts:[{t:`That's Kevin.`,r:`You reply with a single word: 'Kevin.' Within minutes two supporting mails arrive from other departments. The case is thereby considered solved. Evidence was at no point gathered.`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Is that me?`,r:`You sniff discreetly at your own sleeve. The result is inconclusive, and that is exactly what makes you nervous. You decide to be offended as a precaution.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:5,nextEmail:`mail_smell_2`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_smell_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Anonymous`,senderId:`anonymous`,subj:`Re: Unpleasant smell`,body:`Yes, it is you. Deodorant helps. Thank you.`,opts:[{t:`Ouch.`,r:`You read the mail three times and then sniff at the sleeve once more after all. On the way home you buy deodorant, shower gel and, out of spite, a bottle of scent. Anonymous stays anonymous - but they were right.`,m:2,l:0,a:10,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_teambuilding_1`,sender:`HR (Sabine)`,senderId:`hr_sabine`,subj:`Team event: Forest Survival`,body:`We drop you in the woods. No phones. Whoever is back first does not get sacked.`,opts:[{t:`I'm bringing a knife.`,r:`You confirm your attendance and start a packing list: knife, compass, cereal bars, spare socks. If the company wants survival, it gets somebody who takes the emergency literally.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:5},{t:`Call in sick in good time`,r:`Your back reports for duty with impeccable timing. The symptoms are unprovable, irrefutable and last exactly until the end of the team event. A classic of occupational medicine.`,m:2,l:10,a:-5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_printer_color_cyan`,sender:`Printer`,senderId:`printer`,subj:`TONER EMPTY`,body:`Cyan is empty. I cannot print this black and white document, because I need cyan to mix black.`,opts:[{t:`Copy it out by hand`,r:`You copy the document out by hand like a monk in a scriptorium, only with worse handwriting. After the second page your hand cramps. The printer watches you do it. You think you can hear a faint hum.`,m:10,l:-10,a:10,b:0},{t:`Hit the printer`,r:`The blow does nothing for the toner level and a great deal for your inner life. The printer acknowledges it with an error message that was not there before. The two of you understand each other.`,m:5,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_markus_siri`,sender:`Markus the Head of Sales`,senderId:`markus_head_of_sales`,subj:`IMPORTANT FROM THE CAR`,body:`HELLO MILLER EXCLAMATION MARK i URGENTLY need the figures for Techni Plast COMMA the ones from last quarter FULL STOP new paragraph

not the old figures but the NEW old ones FULL STOP

sent from my iPhone while driving Siri you can stop now Siri STOP`,opts:[{t:`Ask precisely: WHICH figures?`,nextEmail:`mail_markus_siri_2`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0,r:`You compose a crystal-clear query with three options to choose from. The answer will come from the car again. You know that. You ask anyway. Hope is a working principle.`},{t:`Just send the most likely figures`,rep:{Markus:3},m:10,l:5,a:0,b:0,r:`You guess your way through the sales jungle and send the quarterly report for TechniPlast. Twenty minutes later: 'PERFECT THANKS EXCLAMATION MARK'. They were the right ones. This time.`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,ignoreEmail:!0,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,r:`What comes from the car can stay in the car. The mail disappears. Markus will be in touch as soon as he parks. So never.`}]},{id:`mail_markus_siri_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Markus the Head of Sales`,senderId:`markus_head_of_sales`,subj:`Re: IMPORTANT FROM THE CAR`,body:`THE FIGURES OBVIOUSLY EXCLAMATION MARK the ones where the customer said they look odd FULL STOP

ask GABI she knows that sort of thing

Siri send to Miller no NOT to Miller Berger to MILLER`,opts:[{t:`'Ring me when you have parked'`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0,r:`The answer arrives four hours later: 'AM PARKED who are you again QUESTION MARK'. Siri has eaten the thread. The matter has, like so much with Markus, sorted itself out along the way.`},{t:`Ask Gabi - of course she knows`,rep:{Gabi:3},m:5,l:5,a:0,b:0,r:`Gabi knows at once: 'The discount tiers. They have been linked wrongly since March, that is what he means.' You send the corrected file. Two people in this building understand sales: Gabi and nobody else.`}]},{id:`mail_markus_loop`,sender:`Markus the Head of Sales`,senderId:`markus_head_of_sales`,subj:`FW: FW: Customer complaint TechniPlast - JUST SO EVERYONE IS IN THE LOOP`,body:`Team,

forwarding this to EVERYONE, full transparency.

@IT: please explain briefly why the system is 'slow'.
@Boss: FYI.
@Accounts: FYI.
@Reception: FYI.

Time is money!
M.

[CC: 74 recipients, including Dr. Wichtig]`,opts:[{t:`Reply all, factually and finally`,m:10,l:0,a:10,b:-5,r:`You explain the cause to the entire distribution list in three sober sentences (the customer is running the 2019 client). It is correct, transparent and read by precisely nobody. But it is in the loop, and the loop is sacred.`},{t:`Reply to Markus only: 'We can sort this between us'`,rep:{Markus:-3},m:5,l:0,a:-5,b:0,r:`He replies - to everyone, naturally: 'IT would like to handle this bilaterally EXCLAMATION MARK Transparency looks different.' You have lost by being reasonable. The classic move of this building.`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,ignoreEmail:!0,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,r:`The loop roars on without you. Around mail fourteen somebody will propose 'discussing this in a meeting'. You will be invited. There is no escaping the loop. There is only postponing it.`}]},{id:`mail_elster_349`,sender:`Frau Elster (Accounts)`,senderId:`elster_accounts`,subj:`Missing receipt: 3.49 EUR (USB cable) - 3rd reminder`,body:`Dear Mr Miller,

for the third time I am reminding you of the missing original receipt for the cash expense of 12.06. (USB cable, 3.49 EUR).

No receipt, no reimbursement. No clarification, no clean year-end accounts.

Deadline: Friday, 12:00.

Kind regards
E. Elster

(This email was checked for spelling before it was sent.)`,opts:[{t:`Begin the desk archaeology`,nextEmail:`mail_elster_349_2`,m:15,l:-5,a:10,b:0,r:`After a quarter of an hour's excavation through three strata of drawer: the receipt is stuck to a cough sweet. It is creased but legible. You scan it with the care of a restorer and submit it.`},{t:`'Let us just forget the 3.49'`,rep:{"Frau Elster":-5},m:2,l:5,a:0,b:5,r:`A fatal misreading. This is not about 3.49 euros. It was NEVER about 3.49 euros. It is about the principle, and the principle now carries an open item in your name. Her reply: 'Waiving it is NOT clarification in accounting terms.'`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,ignoreEmail:!0,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,r:`The fourth reminder will come by internal post. Printed out. With a read-receipt form enclosed. There are opponents against whom ignoring is not a strategy, only an extension of the deadline.`}]},{id:`mail_elster_349_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Frau Elster (Accounts)`,senderId:`elster_accounts`,subj:`Re: Missing receipt - CLOSED`,body:`Dear Mr Miller,

the receipt has arrived and been posted. The matter is closed.

Enclosed for your information: your reimbursement (3.49 EUR) and 0.12 EUR interest for late payment, which you did not apply for but which is due to you.

Order is not harassment.
E. Elster`,opts:[{t:`Give the 12 cents their due`,rep:{"Frau Elster":5},m:2,l:0,a:-5,b:0,r:`You reply: 'The 12 cents have made my day.' Her answer comes after ninety seconds: 'That was the purpose.' Somewhere behind the mountains of files, Ms Elster has smiled. It must be assumed.`},{t:`File it without comment`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0,r:`Matter closed, filed, done. The 12 cents go unremarked. It was a hand held out in fractions of a euro, and you did not see it. Correct in accounting terms. Room for improvement as a human being.`}]},{id:`mail_elster_inventur`,sender:`Frau Elster (Accounts)`,senderId:`elster_accounts`,subj:`Annual IT stocktake: confirmation of asset numbers (214 items)`,body:`Dear Mr Miller,

enclosed is the IT asset list (214 items). Please check EVERY item for actual presence and confirm by the end of the month.

I reserve the right to carry out spot checks.

Kind regards
E. Elster`,opts:[{t:`Confirm all 214 blind`,nextEmail:`mail_elster_inventur_2b`,m:5,l:10,a:0,b:0,r:`Two hundred and fourteen ticks in four minutes - a new house record. The list goes back to Accounts confirmed, where Ms Elster will open it with a very particular look on her face.`},{t:`Delegate to Kevin: stocktake experience!`,rep:{Kevin:3},m:5,l:5,a:0,b:5,r:`Kevin sets off with a clipboard, delighted. Report after three hours: '213 found! And what is a quantum computer?' The lad has found the control item without suspecting it was one. Instinct cannot be taught.`},{t:`Check conscientiously, report anomalies`,nextEmail:`mail_elster_inventur_2a`,m:25,l:-10,a:15,b:0,r:`An afternoon among racks, cupboards and Egon's cellar shelves. 209 items: present. Four: missing. And item 87, 'Quantum computer QX-1, acquired 1997', cannot possibly exist. You report exactly that - along with the question of what a quantum computer is supposed to have cost in 1997.`}]},{id:`mail_elster_inventur_2a`,linked:!0,sender:`Frau Elster (Accounts)`,senderId:`elster_accounts`,subj:`Re: Annual stocktake - item 87`,body:`Dear Mr Miller,

item 87 was a control item.

You are the first since this practice was introduced (2011) to have challenged it.

I have added you to the list of audit-proof contacts. That list now comprises two names.

E. Elster`,opts:[{t:`Be quietly proud`,rep:{"Frau Elster":3},m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0,r:`Some honours need no reply. You are audit-proof from now on - a title of nobility that does not officially exist and that still counts for more in this building than any promotion.`},{t:`'Who is the other name?'`,rep:{"Frau Elster":5},m:2,l:0,a:0,b:0,r:`The answer comes by return and consists of one word: 'Me.' No more honour than that fits on one line in this company. You do not print the mail out. But it was close.`}]},{id:`mail_elster_inventur_2b`,linked:!0,sender:`Frau Elster (Accounts)`,senderId:`elster_accounts`,subj:`Re: Annual stocktake - query regarding item 87`,body:`Dear Mr Miller,

you confirm the presence of item 87: 'Quantum computer QX-1, acquired 1997'.

I invented that item for control purposes.

I suggest you check the list again. This time with your eyes.

E. Elster`,opts:[{t:`Contritely do it properly`,rep:{"Frau Elster":3},m:25,l:-5,a:15,b:0,r:`The second round you do properly: every item, every room, Egon's cellar included. Four devices remain missing, the rest tallies. Her reply to your corrected list: 'There you are. It can be done.' It sounds almost motherly. Almost.`},{t:`'The quantum computer is in Egon's cellar'`,rep:{"Frau Elster":-5},m:2,l:10,a:0,b:5,r:`Humour is not provided for where control items are concerned. Her reply consists of one sentence: 'I have asked Egon.' You have lost. So has Egon, incidentally - he said: 'Could be.' Accounts are now looking for a quantum computer from 1997.`}]},{id:`mail_kevin_anhang`,sender:`Kevin (Apprentice)`,senderId:`kevin_apprentice`,subj:`the file`,body:`heres the file you wanted

cheers kevin`,opts:[{t:`Look for it yourself via remote support`,m:10,l:5,a:5,b:0,r:`You find the file on his desktop. It is called 'definitive_final_NEW(3).xlsx' and sits right next to 'definitive_final_NEW(2).xlsx' and 'definitive_final.xlsx'. You take the one with the highest number. Here is hoping Kevin counts the way the rest of humanity does.`},{t:`'Kevin. The attachment.'`,nextEmail:`mail_kevin_anhang_2`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0,r:`You reply with three words. No more are needed. No more would change anything either.`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,ignoreEmail:!0,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5,r:`If it matters, it will come back. With Kevin it always comes back. Usually three times and with an emoji.`}]},{id:`mail_kevin_anhang_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Kevin (Apprentice)`,senderId:`kevin_apprentice`,subj:`Re: the file`,body:`omg sorry 🙈 for real this time

cheers kevin`,opts:[{t:`Ring him and end it`,m:5,l:0,a:5,b:0,r:`'Oh, THAT'S why the mail went so fast!' Forty seconds on the phone solve what two mails could not. The file arrives. As a download link. Small mercies.`},{t:`Wait in silence - he will notice`,nextEmail:`mail_kevin_anhang_3`,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:0,r:`Still no attachment. You do not reply. Kevin will notice by himself - in your experience after eleven minutes, when the shame seeps in through the headphones.`}]},{id:`mail_kevin_anhang_3`,linked:!0,sender:`Kevin (Apprentice)`,senderId:`kevin_apprentice`,subj:`Re: Re: the file`,body:`ok NOW i get it 😅 attached!!

cheers kevin

[Attachment: IMG_20260801_1337.jpg, 4.2 MB]`,opts:[{t:`Go over and deliver the attachment training`,rep:{Kevin:5},m:10,l:-5,a:5,b:0,r:`You show him the paperclip icon. Kevin: 'So THAT'S where it is!' He writes it down - as a voice memo to himself, but he writes it down. The file arrives two minutes later. As a genuine attachment. It is growth. Some form of it.`},{t:`Preserve the photo for posterity`,m:2,l:5,a:-5,b:0,r:`The attachment is a photo of his screen with the open file on it. Sharply taken, at least. The picture goes into your folder marked 'evidence'. There will be a slideshow at his leaving do. You are already collecting.`}]},{id:`mail_allhands_lasagne`,sender:`Bernd (Sales)`,senderId:`bernd_sales`,subj:`WHO has taken my lasagne out of the fridge???`,body:`Dear 'colleagues',

my lasagne (LABELLED!) has vanished from the fridge. The tub was a present from my mother.

I expect an explanation.

- Bernd (2nd floor)

[To: All. There are already 23 replies to all.]`,opts:[{t:`Savour all 23 replies`,m:10,l:10,a:-10,b:0,r:`The thread contains: two mutual accusations, a debate on the principles of fridge ethics, a meme and Ms Elster's dry reference to the fridge regulations. Best entertainment of the day, entirely free. Almost: it was working hours.`},{t:`Play the IT card: 'I can check the kitchen logs'`,nextEmail:`mail_allhands_lasagne_2`,m:5,l:5,a:-5,b:5,r:`There are no kitchen logs. But the distribution list does not know that. Your mail produces an immediate, almost audible silence in the thread. Power feels exactly like this.`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,ignoreEmail:!0,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5,r:`The avalanche rolls on without you. Tomorrow Bernd's lasagne is corridor folklore, the day after legend, and in a year three witnesses will swear it was a beef olive affair.`}]},{id:`mail_allhands_lasagne_2`,linked:!0,sender:`Jürgen (Sales)`,senderId:`juergen_sales`,subj:`Re: WHO has taken my lasagne... (PRIVATE)`,body:`Mr Miller,

a quick private question between the two of us: these 'kitchen logs'... what exactly do they log? And since when?

Purely out of interest.

- Jürgen (3rd floor)`,opts:[{t:`'Jürgen. We both know.'`,m:5,l:0,a:-5,b:0,r:`Jürgen does not reply. He does not have to. In the canteen he now puts the pudding on your tray without a word. Hush money in dessert form. You accept it. One must be able to take, as well.`},{t:`'Everything. Since 2019.'`,m:2,l:5,a:-10,b:0,r:`An hour later a new, sealed lasagne is standing in the fridge. Beside it a note: 'For Bernd. From a friend.' Case closed - no verdict, no evidence, not one real log. Justice by bluff. The cheapest kind there is.`}]},{id:`mail_security_test`,sender:`IT Security (Group Head Office)`,senderId:`group_it_security`,subj:`Your parcel is waiting! Pay the delivery fee now (1.99 EUR)`,body:`Dear Customer,

your parcel no. DE-8471-B cannot be delivered. Please confirm the delivery fee using the link below.

[Classic phishing styling in poor English. But the mail header tells the trained eye: the sender is your own group security. It is the annual phishing TEST.]`,opts:[{t:`Warn half the company`,m:5,l:5,a:-5,b:5,r:`Your corridor warning steers dozens of colleagues safely through the test. Group security marvels at the best rate in company history - 98 per cent - and announces that it will 'review the test methodology'. You have healed a statistic and thereby made it suspicious.`},{t:`Report it as phishing, like a good boy`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:-5,r:`The model pupil's click. Seconds later: 'Congratulations! You have passed the test.' Somewhere a statistic has just absorbed you, and it will end up on a board slide. On the green side of the bar, at least.`},{t:`Click deliberately - for research`,nextEmail:`mail_security_test_2`,m:5,l:10,a:0,b:0,r:`Scientific curiosity: what happens if you click? The link leads to an instruction page with a sad shield graphic ('This could have been a real attack!') - and an automatic consequence you read one second too late.`}]},{id:`mail_security_test_2`,linked:!0,sender:`IT Security (Group Head Office)`,senderId:`group_it_security`,subj:`Mandatory training: recognising phishing - basics (45 min.)`,body:`Dear Mr Miller,

on the basis of your click behaviour you have been automatically enrolled on the course 'Recognising phishing - basics'.

Attendance is compulsory and will be recorded.

Your IT Security`,opts:[{t:`'I AM the IT.'`,m:10,l:0,a:10,b:5,r:`Group security's reply is impeccably formed: 'Administrators in particular are a high-risk target. Attendance remains compulsory.' They are right, and that is the most annoying part. The course is waiting. It waits patiently.`},{t:`Sit out the 45 minutes with dignity`,m:30,l:10,a:15,b:0,r:`You - the man who could be delivering this course for a living - click through modules such as 'What is a link?'. You print the certificate out and hang it in the office. As a warning. Or a trophy. The line is fluid.`}]},{id:`mail_treiber_kette`,sender:`Petra the Colleague`,senderId:`petra_colleague`,subj:`FW: FW: RE: FW: Re: RE: Printer 3rd floor`,body:`Hello IT,

could you take a look at this? It just came in, nobody knows any more what it was originally about.

Best, Petra

[Below: fourteen levels of forwarding across three weeks, seven signatures, two automatic out-of-office replies]`,opts:[{t:`Mail archaeology: dig down to the original question`,m:15,l:-5,a:10,b:0,r:`Fourteen levels down, dated three weeks ago, you find the original question: 'Is the third-floor printer actually new?' It was new. It is not any more. The question has answered itself purely through the time spent forwarding it. You document the find like a cave researcher.`},{t:`Reply at the very top: 'What is the question?'`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0,r:`Your counter-question is promptly forwarded to four people, two of whom are away. The chain grows by three levels. Whatever you set out to solve, you belong to it now. That is how bureaucracy reproduces: by contact.`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,ignoreEmail:!0,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:5,r:`The chain will keep growing without you. At some point it reaches critical mass and collapses under its own weight into a meeting. That is how they all end.`}]},{id:`mail_ooo_loop`,sender:`System notification`,senderId:`system_notification`,subj:`[WARNING] Mailbox volume: 3,412 new messages since 11:02`,body:`Automatic report:

Two out-of-office replies (H. Bergmann / K. Winter) have been answering each other since 11:02.

You are cc'd as postmaster on every single message.

Current rate: 14 mails/minute. Trend: rising.`,opts:[{t:`Kill the loop server-side`,m:10,l:-5,a:5,b:-5,r:`Two mail rules, one restart of the auto-responder: silence. Then you delete 3,412 system mails with a single, deeply satisfying click. Bergmann and Winter will come back from holiday one day and never learn what storm their courtesy set off.`},{t:`Watch a while longer, see how far it goes`,m:5,l:10,a:-5,b:5,r:`There is something meditative about it: two machines tirelessly assuring each other that they are not currently there. At five thousand you step in. The screenshot of the counter at 4,999 now hangs in your folder for special moments.`},{t:`Let physics decide: storage is finite`,m:2,l:10,a:0,b:10,r:`Every storage system fills up eventually, so this will sort itself out. Unfortunately the storage belongs to the company, and group head office's monitoring watches it fill in real time. The query from above is faster than the overflow. Considerably faster.`}]},{id:`mail_falle_fuenf_minuten`,sender:`Dr. Wichtig`,senderId:`boss`,subj:`Quick question`,body:`Mr Miller,

have you got five minutes for me later?

W.`,opts:[{t:`'What is it about?'`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:15,r:`A perfectly reasonable query - except that it reads differently at board level: whoever asks about the topic is negotiating over their availability. The answer comes four hours later and consists of a single sentence: 'About five minutes, Mr Miller.' The meeting is in the diary regardless. So is the coolness.`},{t:`'Of course, any time!'`,m:25,l:5,a:25,b:0,r:`The five minutes begin at 14:00 and end as a project outline: Dr Wichtig would like to 'think digitalisation through afresh', and because you had time so readily, the thinking is yours to do with him. First working draft: by Friday. Five minutes is a currency in boss time, with an exchange rate all of its own.`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,ignoreEmail:!0,m:2,l:5,a:0,b:15,r:`You do not ignore two-liners from the CEO - two-liners from the CEO are not mails, they are summonses in plain clothes. At 15:30 he is standing at your desk in person: 'You will have overlooked my mail.' The word 'will' carries the entire evidential weight of that sentence.`}]},{id:`mail_falle_richtlinie`,sender:`IT Compliance (Group Head Office)`,senderId:`group_it_compliance`,subj:`Updated IT policy - confirmation required (1 click)`,body:`Dear colleagues,

the IT usage policy has been updated (attached, 14 pages). Please confirm that you have read it with a single click.

Confirmation is compulsory by Friday.

Your Group Compliance`,opts:[{t:`Confirm at once - it is only a click`,m:2,l:5,a:30,b:5,r:`One click, done, good boy. Three weeks later head office invokes clause 14b of the version you confirmed: 'Administrators shall ensure availability at weekends within reasonable limits.' You read that. It says so in your confirmation. What counts as reasonable is not, incidentally, defined by the person expecting it.`},{t:`Read the 14 pages properly first`,m:20,l:0,a:10,b:0,r:`Twenty minutes of administrative prose, and you find it: clause 14b, weekend availability, tucked neatly between the password rules and the printer policy. Your formal objection goes out the same day. Whether it changes anything is open - but nobody can ever claim you agreed. Reading: priceless. And unpaid.`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,ignoreEmail:!0,m:2,l:5,a:5,b:10,r:`From Monday the reminder arrives daily at 8:01, from Wednesday with your line manager copied in, and the subject line grows by one more 'REMINDER:' every day. Compliance systems know no fatigue. Only escalation levels.`}]},{id:`mail_falle_mentor`,sender:`HR`,senderId:`hr_department`,subj:`Congratulations - you have been nominated!`,body:`Dear Mr Miller,

we are delighted to inform you that you have been nominated for the new MENTORING PROGRAMME! You will be accompanying three junior colleagues on their way.

The programme starts next week. Our warmest congratulations!

Your HR team`,opts:[{t:`'Who nominated me?'`,m:5,l:5,a:5,b:5,r:`The answer beams back: 'Mr Markus from Sales - in thanks for your wonderful support!' Markus wanted to do you a good turn and has given you three apprentices. Withdrawing the nomination would wound him and confuse HR. You are a mentor from now on. Out of gratitude. His.`},{t:`Accept the honour - it is a distinction!`,m:10,l:10,a:25,b:0,r:`The distinction turns out to be a timetable: three junior colleagues, weekly 'sparring sessions', development forms in triplicate - all on top of the actual work, naturally, because 'mentoring is an honour'. Honours in this building are unpaid and diarised as a matter of principle.`},{t:`Decline politely: no capacity`,m:5,l:0,a:5,b:10,r:`Your matter-of-fact refusal is 'noted with regret' and goes into your personnel file as a comment: 'Willingness to develop: limited.' At the next pay review that very word will be on the table. You can decline honours in this building. But not free of charge.`}]},{id:`mail_onboarding_wrong`,sender:`Staff Development`,senderId:`staff_development`,subj:`Login details for our new colleague (please forward)`,body:`Good morning Mr Miller,

as Ms Miller from onboarding remains off sick and you are directly above her on our distribution list, we are sending you the login details for our new Junior Assistant. You work with computers all day anyway.

Login: j_schnoesel
Password: Synergy123!

Note from IT: the initial password is identical for every account in the building and must not be changed, as that confuses the database.

Please forward this mail on to him. He has no mailbox of his own yet.`,opts:[{t:`Print it out and put it on Schnösel's desk`,r:`You print the login details out and put the sheet on Schnösel's keyboard. The printout stays there for three weeks, password side up. He has got it, at least.`,m:10,l:0,a:-5,b:0},{t:`'Wrong recipient, my account is called miller.'`,r:`You explain in two sentences that you are not Schnösel, that your account is simply called 'miller', and that login details should not be wandering through the building by email. Send. Nobody will read it.`,m:5,l:0,a:5,b:0,nextEmail:`mail_onboarding_reply`},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]},{id:`mail_onboarding_reply`,linked:!0,sender:`Staff Development`,senderId:`staff_development`,subj:`Re: Login details for our new colleague (please forward)`,body:`Dear Mr Miller,

thank you for pointing this out. You were indeed not the intended recipient.

We therefore ask you to delete the preceding email immediately and in full, for data protection reasons. Written confirmation of the deletion is required.

Your account miller is of course unaffected by the matter. It uses the same password.`,opts:[{t:`Confirm the deletion in writing`,r:`You confirm in writing the deletion of an email that is still open in front of you. The matter is thereby considered closed. The building's data protection rate goes up.`,m:5,l:5,a:0,b:0},{t:`Read that last sentence twice`,r:`It uses the same password. Every account uses the same password. Ticket #4711, open since 2019, owner: you.`,m:2,l:0,a:5,b:0},{t:`Delete & ignore`,r:`Email deleted without comment.`,m:2,l:0,a:0,b:10,ignoreEmail:!0}]}];export{e as emails};